# Run ABCXAUTO in Cursor

When starting the trader from Cursor (terminal, debug, or an agent shell), launch the Pro desktop so the Grok think stream is visible:

```powershell
python -m abcxauto
```

Do not use `--headless` unless the operator explicitly asks for console-only (`ABCXAUTO_FORCE_HEADLESS=1`). One IBKR client id (77). Kill leftovers before a second launch.
